SYSTEM/1 airline OK
STATE 0
DISPLAY 9
PANAMAC COMMANDS
A<DATE><ORIG><DEST>  AVAILABILITY
<N><CLASS><LINE>     SELL SEATS
-SURNAME/FIRST       ADD NAME
*R                   DISPLAY RECORD
LIST PSGR/FLTS PFX*  LIST FILE
E                    END, GET LOCATOR
I                    IGNORE
SO                   SIGN OFF
LINE UP
END
